LeNet-5 ASIC -- sky130hd-mapped netlist checks, 2026-08-15
==========================================================

Filtered evidence log. Two targets, one PDK, one machine:

  make equiv-mapped   formal RTL == sky130hd netlist (yosys 0.68, SAT)
  make gls            the existing testbenches re-run against those netlists
                      (yosys 0.68 for mapping, Icarus Verilog 12.0 to simulate)

PDK: /root/OpenROAD-flow-scripts/flow/platforms/sky130hd/lib/
     sky130_fd_sc_hd__tt_025C_1v80.lib

What was filtered: yosys prints one line per equivalence point and per cell,
which runs to hundreds of KB. Kept here are the tool banners, the mapped cell
counts and areas, the equivalence tallies and the testbench verdicts. Nothing
was edited. Regenerate the full trace with:

  make equiv-mapped 2>&1 | tee equiv_mapped_raw.log
  make gls          2>&1 | tee gls_raw.log

Neither target runs in CI: both need the sky130hd liberty from an ORFS
install, which the GitHub runner does not have. docs/VERIFICATION_PLAN.md
states the full scope, including what these checks do not cover.

