------------------------------------------------------------------
3. Mutation campaigns -- proof that both tiers can fail
------------------------------------------------------------------
Mutations are applied to the netlist AFTER mapping and BEFORE the check, which
is the failure being guarded against: a netlist that does not implement its
RTL. Five per block -- drop an inverter, AND becomes OR, OR becomes AND, tie an
output bit low, invert a gate input. Each campaign runs an unmutated control
first, because "all caught" is also the score of a harness that always fails.

== equiv-mapped mutation campaign: avg_pool2x2_int8
  M0-control-unmutated: control PROVES (rc=0)
  M1-drop-an-inverter: CAUGHT (rc=1)
  M2-and-becomes-or: CAUGHT (rc=1)
  M3-or-becomes-and: CAUGHT (rc=1)
  M4-tie-an-output-low: CAUGHT (rc=1)
  M5-invert-a-gate-input: CAUGHT (rc=1)
== equiv-mapped mutation campaign: requantize
  M0-control-unmutated: control PROVES (rc=0)
  M1-drop-an-inverter: CAUGHT (rc=1)
  M2-and-becomes-or: CAUGHT (rc=1)
  M3-or-becomes-and: CAUGHT (rc=1)
  M4-tie-an-output-low: CAUGHT (rc=1)
  M5-invert-a-gate-input: CAUGHT (rc=1)

== gls mutation campaign: requantize / tb_requantize
  M0-control-unmutated: control PASSES (harness is not stuck failing)
  M1-drop-an-inverter: CAUGHT
  M2-and-becomes-or: CAUGHT
  M3-or-becomes-and: CAUGHT
  M4-tie-an-output-low: CAUGHT
  M5-invert-a-gate-input: CAUGHT
== gls mutation campaign: conv5x5_pe / tb_conv5x5_pe
  M0-control-unmutated: control PASSES (harness is not stuck failing)
  M1-drop-an-inverter: CAUGHT
  M2-and-becomes-or: CAUGHT
  M3-or-becomes-and: SURVIVED
  M4-tie-an-output-low: no line matches. The mutation looks for a bit-indexed
                        output assign; here out_data_o is registered (non-
                        blocking, inside an always block) and in_ready_o is a
                        whole-signal assign, so nothing matches. Counted as not
                        run, not as caught.
  M5-invert-a-gate-input: CAUGHT
== gls mutation campaign: avg_pool2x2_int8 / tb_avg_pool2x2_stream
  M0-control-unmutated: control PASSES (harness is not stuck failing)
  M1-drop-an-inverter: SURVIVED
  M2-and-becomes-or: CAUGHT
  M3-or-becomes-and: CAUGHT
  M4-tie-an-output-low: CAUGHT
  M5-invert-a-gate-input: CAUGHT
== gls mutation campaign: dense_row_mac / tb_dense_engine
  M0-control-unmutated: control PASSES (harness is not stuck failing)
  M1-drop-an-inverter: CAUGHT
  M2-and-becomes-or: SURVIVED
