  M4-tie-an-output-low: CAUGHT
  M5-invert-a-gate-input: SURVIVED

Totals: equiv-mapped 10/10 caught. gls 14/19 valid mutations caught.

The five gls survivors are discussed in docs/VERIFICATION_PLAN.md and the sixth
addendum of results/VERIFICATION_SUMMARY.md rather than left as a number. A
mutation survives when the testbench's stimulus never drives that node into an
observable difference, so the score measures the stimulus and not the netlist --
which is why dense_row_mac, reached through five F6 output values, scores 2/5,
and why the avg_pool2x2_int8 survivor is caught outright by equiv-mapped.
